# Verification Workflow

After editing `src/main/java`, `src/test/java`, `pom.xml`, or `application.yml`, verify changes before finishing the task.

Use [`scripts/check.sh`](scripts/check.sh) — never paste full Maven logs into chat.

## Tiers

| Tier | When | Action |
|------|------|--------|
| 0 | Always | `read_lints` on edited files; fix before proceeding |
| 1 | Java edits | `./scripts/check.sh compile` |
| 2 | Logic changes | `./scripts/check.sh test <classes>` (see mapping) |
| 3 | Before done | `./scripts/check.sh verify` |

## File → test mapping

| Edited | Run |
|--------|-----|
| `controller/{Entity}Controller.java` | `{Entity}ControllerTests` |
| `service/{Entity}Service.java` | `{Entity}ServiceTests` |
| `mapper/{Entity}Mapper.java` | `{Entity}ServiceTests` |
| `dto/**/{Entity}*` | `{Entity}ControllerTests,{Entity}ServiceTests` |
| `repository/{Entity}Repository.java` | `{Entity}ServiceTests` |
| `exception/GlobalExceptionHandler.java`, `common/ApiResponseBuilder.java` | all `*ControllerTests`, `DbBackendApplicationTests` |
| `pom.xml`, `application.yml`, `DbBackendApplication.java` | skip Tier 2 → run `verify` |

New resource: run both `{Entity}ControllerTests` and `{Entity}ServiceTests` before `verify`.

## Token budget

- **Success:** one-line summary from script output only (e.g. `verify: BUILD SUCCESS, 22 tests, 0 failures`)
- **Failure:** paste only the script's failure excerpt; fix and re-run the **same** check before broadening scope
- Do not run raw `./mvnw test` or `./mvnw verify` and dump stdout into chat

## Fix loop

1. Check fails → fix the cause
2. Re-run the same tier (targeted test, not full verify)
3. Run `./scripts/check.sh verify` only once targeted checks pass

## Not automated

- `api-testing/*.http` and `scripts/run-local.sh` need live PostgreSQL + `.env` — manual human smoke only
